      "term": "Half treble",
      "definition": "UK: htr (US: hdc). Yarn over before inserting hook, pull up loop (3 loops on hook), yarn over and draw through all 3 in one go. Taller than dc, shorter than treble."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "Two chains at the start of each htr row. Counts as the first htr."
    },
